            "text": "<p>Emeralds are celebrated as one of the four precious gemstones, known for their deep green color and rarity. Mined primarily in Colombia, Brazil, and Zambia, these gemstones range in shades from translucent lime to rich, dark forest green. The vibrant green of an emerald, often associated with the rejuvenating energy of spring, makes it a popular choice for high-end jewelry and significant gifts.</p><p></p>",
